; XauUsdTradePreview v1.04 - HYPOTHETICAL daily-limit BLOCK test (T012). Observation only: no order is sent, changed, cancelled or closed.
; Every number below is a TEST value, none is a client fact and none comes from a real account. The closed result -250.00 is invented
; (it is NOT the +3.57 of the earlier manual test and it is not a robot result). The other policies stay UNKNOWN on purpose: the final
; preview result is BLOCK anyway; what you check is the "T012 DAILY" log line and the "DAILY" panel line.
; BEFORE RUNNING: (1) set InpEntry / InpStopLoss to levels that pass the T008 checks for the CURRENT XAUUSD quote (the daily block is evaluated
; after the plan and the broker probe; if they stop first you see GEOMETRY / PLAN instead); (2) set InpDailySnapshotDay to TODAY's Tirane date
; as yyyymmdd (15 October 2026 = 20261015). A different day gives STALE_SNAPSHOT_DAY, which is also a valid block test.
; EXPECTED log: T012 DAILY source=DAILY_SNAPSHOT allowed=0 primary=DAILY_LOSS_LIMIT reasons=DAILY_LOSS_LIMIT|POLICY_UNSET:max_trades_per_day
;   cancel_pending_due=1 daily_limit_reached=1 ... then T008 PREVIEW RESULT BLOCK with "DAILY: ..." in the reasons.
; The preview uses TimeGMT() (PC clock) for the daily source and refuses it in the Strategy Tester.
